# The same deadlock spread over three tasks, where no pair of task files says
# anything wrong on its own. What is traced back is the whole loop, because the
# task to fix is not necessarily the one the walk closed on.
run available
exit 3
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: [M1-03]
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/M1-02.md
	---
	id: M1-02
	depends_on: [M1-01]
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/M1-03.md
	---
	id: M1-03
	depends_on: [M1-02]
	exclusive: no
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: tasks/M1-02.md: depends_on M1-01 closes a cycle: M1-01 -> M1-03 -> M1-02 -> M1-01
